00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.033
- Yeah, probably so.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:30.673
Probably so.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.043
- [Mark] What advice would you give

00:10:35.043 --> 00:10:36.970
to a young girl who is
considering doing this?

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.523
- Well, my advice would be,

00:10:44.988 --> 00:10:47.097
if you're going to do it,

00:10:47.097 --> 00:10:50.650
just make sure that you protect yourself,

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.290
because the streets don't love nobody,

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:56.330
and, you just gotta be careful.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.673
You can't trust everybody.

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:05.220
Us black women we're queens
and we should stand tall

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.650
for ourselves and not look
at ourselves as nothing

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:12.680
because this is nothing,
walking the streets,

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.830
selling our bodies,
like anything can happen

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.610
we could die, get raped, get kidnapped

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:19.210
and anything

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.750
living this lifestyle,
I feel like this is the

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.130
risk that I'm taking like

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.280
I could die anyday, getting in cars

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.830
with these tricks, I don't know

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.470
I've been through some s... low key

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.220
I just never say anything to nobody

00:11:37.874 --> 00:11:38.713
